Example 4: Advanced Book Component with Functions

================================================================================

export default function Book() {

  const book = {
    title: 'The Great Gatsby',
    author: 'F. Scott Fitzgerald',
    price: 12.99,
    discount: 0.2,
    pages: 180,
    rating: 4.5
  };

  // Calculate discounted price
  const getDiscountedPrice = () => {
    return book.price * (1 - book.discount);
  };

  // Get discount percentage
  const getDiscountPercentage = () => {
    return book.discount * 100;
  };

  // Format price
  const formatPrice = (price) => {
    return '$' + price.toFixed(2);
  };

  return (
    <div className="book">

      <h2>{book.title}</h2>

      <p>
        By {book.author}
      </p>

      <p>
        Original Price:
        {formatPrice(book.price)}
      </p>

      <p>
        Discount:
        {getDiscountPercentage()}%
      </p>

      <p>
        Sale Price:
        {formatPrice(getDiscountedPrice())}
      </p>

      <p>
        Pages: {book.pages}
      </p>

      <p>
        Rating: {book.rating} / 5
        {book.rating >= 4
          ? ' ⭐ Highly Rated'
          : ''}
      </p>

      <button>
        Save
        {' '}
        {formatPrice(
          book.price - getDiscountedPrice()
        )}
      </button>

    </div>
  );
}

Function Explanation
Function                  | Purpose                         | Result
--------------------------|---------------------------------|---------
getDiscountedPrice()      | Calculate discounted price      | $10.39*
getDiscountPercentage()   | Convert discount to percentage  | 20
formatPrice(price)        | Format value to 2 decimals      | $12.99


* 12.99 × 0.8 = 10.392, displayed as $10.39 by toFixed(2).

Savings:

$12.99 - $10.392 = $2.598
                     ↓
                 toFixed(2)
                     ↓
                   $2.60


Output:

The Great Gatsby
By F. Scott Fitzgerald

Original Price: $12.99

Discount: 20%

Sale Price: $10.39

Pages: 180

Rating: 4.5 / 5 ⭐ Highly Rated

[Save $2.60]


