Important Note About Arrays

React can render arrays of renderable values/elements.

For example:

{[1, 2, 3]}


can result in the values being rendered next to each other.

For structured list UI, normally use:

<ul>
  {[1, 2, 3].map(number => (
    <li key={number}>
      {number}
    </li>
  ))}
</ul>


