Can functions be called in JSX?  | Yes, e.g. {getPrice()}
Can if be written directly in {}?| No, use an expression/logic outside JSX
How do you write conditionals?   | Ternary or && are common options
How do you render arrays?        | Usually with map()
Why is key required for lists?   | Helps React identify sibling items
What key should you prefer?      | Stable unique ID from the data
Can calculations be in JSX?      | Yes
Should complex logic stay in JSX?| Usually better to extract it


