ONE-LINE INTERVIEW ANSWER

================================================================================

In JSX, curly braces {} allow JavaScript expressions such as variables, calculations, function calls, ternary expressions, object properties, and map() calls to produce dynamic UI. Statements such as if and for are normally handled outside JSX or replaced with expressions.

